    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "The dot product $\\underset{\\sim}{u}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{v}=24$ where $\\underset{\\sim}{u}=\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}$ and $\\underset{\\sim}{v}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\4\\end{pmatrix}$. Find the value of $x$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$x=-12$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{aligned}\\underset{\\sim}{u}\\cdot\\underset{\\sim}{v}=x(-1)+3(4)&=24\\\\-x+12&=24\\\\x&=-12\\end{aligned}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
